<section class="container page-intro narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy notice</p><h1>Your enquiry information.</h1><p class="lead">We use the details you submit to review and respond to your business enquiry.</p></section><section class="container prose section-topless"><h2>What the form collects</h2><p>Your name, company, business email, country, buyer type, selected instruments, quantities and any requirements you enter are stored with your enquiry reference. Please do not include patient information or sensitive personal data.</p><h2>How it is handled</h2><p>Enquiries are stored on the website’s server for review by the business. Where email notifications are configured, the enquiry is also sent to the business mailbox through its email provider. The information is not used by this website for advertising.</p><h2>Browser storage and security</h2><p>Your quote list stays in this browser using local storage until you remove items or clear browser data. The form uses a security cookie, valid for up to 24 hours. Hashed network addresses are temporarily used to limit abusive submissions. This site does not include advertising or analytics trackers.</p><h2>Access and deletion</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:info@surgicalessence.com">info@surgicalessence.com</a> with your enquiry reference to ask about your information or request deletion. Enquiry records remain in business storage until removed. Contact us to discuss access, correction or deletion of your enquiry.</p></section>
